{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And your eyes</b> — see this. And it would have been fitting that you acknowledge HaShem and say, 'YHWH be magnified.'" "<b>And it is possible that</b> beyond the border of Israel <b>you</b> is connected with. And so it is: you who dwell beyond the border, you shall say, 'HaShem be magnified.' And after he explained how HaShem loved Jacob, Elohim comes to reprove the nobles among them, who are teachers of Torah and they are the priests."], :book :malachi, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Malachi -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/malachi"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:05.839293902Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}